[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4741.91, "timestamp": "01:19:01", "text": "我见过最疯狂的事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4742.95, "timestamp": "01:19:02", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4745.43, "timestamp": "01:19:05", "text": "我没睡。你也没睡。什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4748.95, "timestamp": "01:19:08", "text": "但她身后是帝国。我是否站得住脚？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 4752.987, "timestamp": "01:19:12", "author": "@bakononcopiumm", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/hb5sPAHLUD7fBrZZsmfkzISQWwRqI8BY1n8lceyhZz0sNISomD05pCwUe-GL2amD5y-voH_uYw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "r you sick?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4753.27, "timestamp": "01:19:13", "text": "机会？至少目前不是。我需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4760.87, "timestamp": "01:19:20", "text": "Snow刚才不是跟你说了吗？它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4762.55, "timestamp": "01:19:22", "text": "你生病了吗？是的，我感冒了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4764.07, "timestamp": "01:19:24", "text": "打算再去那里。这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4767.51, "timestamp": "01:19:27", "text": "南行的列车拖着沉重的……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4770.229, "timestamp": "01:19:30", "text": "差旅费用。你至少需要一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4772.87, "timestamp": "01:19:32", "text": "几千枚银币"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4773.59, "timestamp": "01:19:33", "text": "工作。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4775.51, "timestamp": "01:19:35", "text": "即使你宁愿乞求也能过去"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4778.07, "timestamp": "01:19:38", "text": "即使是海伯利亚平原，你仍然需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4779.91, "timestamp": "01:19:39", "text": "以某种方式应对检查"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4782.79, "timestamp": "01:19:42", "text": "你路过的每一个城镇。下次，你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4785.669, "timestamp": "01:19:45", "text": "或许没那么幸运。啊，确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4788.31, "timestamp": "01:19:48", "text": "说不定你会发现"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4790.87, "timestamp": "01:19:50", "text": "你自己却在监狱里受苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4793.43, "timestamp": "01:19:53", "text": "我不想那样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4795.75, "timestamp": "01:19:55", "text": "正确的。追溯到过去是不可能的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4797.75, "timestamp": "01:19:57", "text": "野餐。我必须"}]